<title>USA: Grain ships loading at Portland - USDA.</title>
<headline>Grain ships loading at Portland - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portland Merchant's Exchange reported a total of seven grain ships loading at Portland and five grain ships waiting to load, according to the USDA.</p>
